WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.378
♪♪

00:00:03.378 --> 00:00:04.755
Peter:
Give thanks to God.

00:00:04.796 --> 00:00:07.049
♪♪

00:00:07.049 --> 00:00:08.425
The Lord is with us.

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:12.512
What can a mere man do to me?

00:00:12.596 --> 00:00:14.681
(Cage door slams shut)

00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:15.599
♪♪

00:00:15.599 --> 00:00:17.309
Son:
Papa!

00:00:17.309 --> 00:00:19.478
I will come back to you!

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:26.985
♪♪

00:00:27.069 --> 00:00:28.654
You walk the earth...

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:31.490
♪♪

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:32.908
Fassel:
...because I let you.

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.244
♪♪

00:00:35.244 --> 00:00:36.662
Fassel:
I'm your God now.

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:38.038
(Dog barks)

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:41.750
♪♪

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:43.252
Slaves are free.

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.713
♪♪

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:48.340
Peter:
We must get to Baton Rouge.

00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:49.883
Peter:
Through the swamp.

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:50.801
♪♪

00:00:50.801 --> 00:00:51.969
Peter:
Lincoln's army is there.

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:56.098
There are many ways to die in a
swamp.

00:00:56.348 --> 00:00:57.516
(Gun-shot)

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:00.060
(Whistles)

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:01.979
(Dogs barking)

00:01:02.688 --> 00:01:04.940
(Horses galloping)

00:01:05.357 --> 00:01:18.370
♪♪

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:20.247
Peter:
I must get to my family.

00:01:20.247 --> 00:01:24.835
♪♪

00:01:24.876 --> 00:01:26.295
What if he don't come back?

00:01:26.336 --> 00:01:30.340
♪♪

00:01:30.382 --> 00:01:32.092
Your papa is going to be back.

00:01:32.134 --> 00:01:34.177
Dodienne:
Do not ever stop believing that.

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:36.096
He's persistent.

00:01:36.471 --> 00:01:38.682
Fassel:
Running, hiding.

00:01:39.016 --> 00:01:40.058
Fassel:
Surviving.

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:48.650
♪♪

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:49.484
(Canon fires)

00:01:49.526 --> 00:01:55.407
♪♪

00:01:55.407 --> 00:01:56.616
Peter:
I fight them.

00:01:58.910 --> 00:01:59.953
Peter:
They beat me.

00:02:01.913 --> 00:02:03.040
Peter:
They whip me.

00:02:04.207 --> 00:02:06.001
Peter:
They break the bones

00:02:07.377 --> 00:02:08.503
Peter:
in my body

00:02:10.088 --> 00:02:12.007
Peter:
more times than I can count.

00:02:12.132 --> 00:02:19.514
♪♪

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:21.767
But they never,

00:02:23.852 --> 00:02:25.479
never break me.

00:02:25.562 --> 00:02:32.110
♪♪

00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:32.944
(Camera shutter clicks)

00:02:33.862 --> 00:02:36.281
(Whistles)

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:42.579
♪♪

